const WALK_AUDIO={"voice":"af_heart","speed":0.88,"lines":{"intro":{"t":"This is your token board book. Four laminated pages are bound on the left, with a tab for each: Choices, Targets, Board, and Tokens.","d":9.739,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"ch_show":{"t":"Page one is the Choices page. Show it before the task begins. Every picture should be something your learner values right now, not something they can get any time, or have just had plenty of.","d":12.789,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"ch_pick":{"t":"Your learner looks over the pictures and picks one to work for. If needed, help with the pointing, but let your learner make the choice.","d":8.139,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tg_show":{"t":"Page two is the Targets page, where you choose what to teach: a new skill, or a replacement behavior from the behavior plan. If the target is asking for something, like a break, still give what was asked for, every time.","d":14.517,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tg_pick":{"t":"Choose one target at a time. Agree with the other adults on exactly what counts, so everyone gives tokens for the same thing.","d":8.245,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"bd_place":{"t":"Page three is the Board. Place the target under First, and the chosen item under Then. Your learner can now see the plan: first the target, then the item.","d":10.208,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tk_page":{"t":"Page four is the Tokens page, where the tokens wait. The empty slots on the board show your learner how many are left to earn. Make new tokens valuable first; the tips at the end show how.","d":13.003,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"rule":{"t":"Before you start, decide how much of the target behavior earns a token: how many times, or how long. Keep it small, so your learner can succeed. This example uses one token for every two minutes.","d":13.6,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"start":{"t":"Now start the session. Point to the board and name both pictures: first the target, then the item. The ring counts down each two-minute interval, sped up for this video.","d":11.36,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tok_first":{"t":"The interval is over, and your learner kept up the target behavior the whole time. Give a token right away, with brief praise that names what they did. Let your learner put it in the next slot.","d":12.448,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tok_none":{"t":"If the behavior stops, there is no token for that interval, but the earned tokens stay on the board. Calmly remind your learner what to do right away, and start the interval over when they begin again.","d":12.427,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tok_more":{"t":"Each interval with the target behavior earns another token, given right away with a few words of praise. The board fills up, one slot at a time.","d":9.717,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tok_last_term":{"t":"One more interval earns the last token. It looks different: this is the terminal token, earned just like the others. With practice, it tells your learner that the board is finished and the item comes next.","d":13.643,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tok_last":{"t":"One more interval with the target behavior, and the last token goes in. Now the board is full, and your learner has earned the item they chose.","d":9.205,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"exchange":{"t":"The board is full, so trade the tokens for the Then item right away, especially while the board is new. Your learner gets it for the time or amount set before the session.","d":11.04,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"reset":{"t":"When the time with the item is up, put it away, and return the pictures to their pages. Then your learner chooses again for the next round.","d":8.587,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"tips":{"t":"Three tips. Make the tokens valuable first: give one and trade it for the item right away, again and again, until your learner reaches for the token. Start with a small requirement and few tokens, and raise them slowly; if the behavior falls apart, go back a step. Keep the item available only through the board.","d":21.003,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},"outro":{"t":"That's the whole cycle: choose, set the target, earn the tokens, and exchange. Over time, the target behavior should happen more often; if not, change the item or the requirement. The back of each page tells you more.","d":14.837,"a":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"}}};
